<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — Ed Chapman"
  description="Privacy on edwardchapman.co.uk: no analytics, no cookies, no tracking."
>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>
    This site has no analytics, cookies, tracking scripts, or accounts. Reading
    it leaves no record with me beyond the ordinary request logs Cloudflare
    processes to operate the site.
  </p>
  <p>
    When you use <a href="/ask">Ask about Ed's work</a>, your question is sent
    to Anthropic to generate an answer, and is recorded in the site's
    operational logs so abuse of the assistant can be detected. Those logs
    expire automatically after a short period; answers are never stored, and
    there is no database or account system behind this site. Do not include
    personal or sensitive information in a question.
  </p>
  <p>
    Questions about any of this:
    <a href="mailto:ed@edwardchapman.co.uk">ed@edwardchapman.co.uk</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
